# Agile Poker Board - Playwright Test Suite

End-to-end tests for agilepokerboard

## Prerequisites
- Node.js 18+

## Running Tests
```bash
npx playwright test     # all tests
npx playwright test tests/login.spec.ts # one file
npx playwright test --headed=chromium   # one browser
npx playwright tests --headed   # watch it run
npx playwright test --ui    # interactive UI mode
npx playwright test --debug    #step-through debugger
npx playwright test --grep @smoke   # tagged subset
```

## Reports and Artifacts
```bash
npx playwright show-report
```